G-Cam MQTT:

For Live Stream Request: 
{"command":"Live Stream","token":"GCAM_SECRET_123"}

For Manual Garbage Detection: 
{"command":"Garbage Detect","token":"GCAM_SECRET_123"}

For Checking Device Status & Data:
{"command":"Data Status","token":"GCAM_SECRET_123"}

For Audio Streaming (DVM-Direct Voice Message):
{"command":"Audio File Play","audio_name":"Store Ravi Announcement.mp3","token":"GCAM_SECRET_123"}
or
{"command":"Audio File Play","audio_path":"/home/ftpuser/ftp/files/Audio/Store Ravi Announcement.mp3","token":"GCAM_SECRET_123"}

For Close the G-Cam Software:
{"command":"Close The Software","token":"GCAM_SECRET_123"}

For Open the G-Cam Software:
{"command":"Open The Software","token":"GCAM_SECRET_123"}

For Restart the Device:
{"command":"Device Restart","token":"GCAM_SECRET_123"}

